    "title": "API-DocTest-Create Telecom Sim Swap-v4-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom SIM Swap API facilitates the seamless replacement of a customer's SIM card while maintaining their mobile service continuity. This endpoint allows service providers to efficiently process SIM swap requests, ensuring that subscribers can quickly regain access to their accounts and mobile services after a lost or damaged SIM card. Typical consumers include telecom operators and customer service teams managing user account transitions. This enhances customer satisfaction by minimizing downtime during the SIM replacement process.",
